msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Examples.Filter"
msgid "<html>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"This example demonstrates various options of the\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.Filter\">Filter</a> block.\n"
