"the input signal <strong>u</strong> falls below the <strong>reference</strong> signal minus half of\n"
"the bandwidth and sets the output signal <strong>y</strong> to <strong>false</strong> when the input\n"
"signal <strong>u</strong> exceeds the <strong>reference</strong> signal plus half of the bandwidth.</p>\n"
"</html>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Logical.OnOffController"
