msgctxt "Modelica.Blocks.Math.Cosh"
msgid "<html>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This blocks computes the output <strong>y</strong> as the\n"
"<em>hyperbolic cosine</em> of the input <strong>u</strong>:\n"
