"<p>\n"
"This block computes the output <strong>y</strong>\n"
"as <em>Real equivalent</em> of the Integer input <strong>u</strong>:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\n"
"y = u;\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\n"
"<p>where <strong>u</strong> is of Integer and <strong>y</strong> of Real type.</p>\n"
"</html>"
