"The DeadZone block defines a region of zero output.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"If the input is within uMin ... uMax, the output\n"
"is zero. Outside of this zone, the output is a linear\n"
"function of the input with a slope of 1.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</html>"
