"<em>exponential</em> (of base e) of the input <code>u</code>. Optionally, the input <code>u</code> can be processed conjugate complex, when parameter <code>useConjugateInput</code> is <code>true</code>. Depending on <code>useConjugateInput</code> the internal signal <code>uInternal</code> represents either the original or the conjugate complex input signal.\n"
