"<dd><strong>The CODATA 2017 values of h, e, k, and NA for the revision of the SI</strong> in Metrologia, Volume 55, Number 1.\n"
"<a href= \"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1681-7575/aa950a/pdf\">https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1681-7575/aa950a/pdf</a>, 2017.\n"
