msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Digital.Converters"
msgid "<html>\n"
"<p>The Converter BooleanToLogic, LogicToBoolean, RealToLogic, and LogicTo Real components are not standard logic components. They were designed to easily convert from or to Boolean or Real valued signals. The LogicToX01, LogicToX01Z and LogicTo UX01 converters correspond to standard logic functions. They transform 9-valued logic to 3- or 4-valued logic.</p>\n"
"</html>"
