msgctxt "Modelica.Electrical.Spice3.Examples.Nor"
msgid "<html>\n"
"<p>In nearly every electronic the basic circuit &quot;nor&quot; is used. A nor contains two PMOS and two NMOS. The faulty wiring can be seen in the graphical mode. If and only if the two input voltages have low potential, the output voltage has high potential, otherwise the output voltage has low potential.</p>\n"
