"\n"
"<p>which can also be expressed in terms complex phasors:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<blockquote>\n"
"<img src=\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Magnetic/FundamentalWave/Components/reluctance_alt.png\"\n"
