"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.ConnectionOfLineForces\">MultiBody.UsersGuide.Tutorial.ConnectionOfLineForces</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
