"<h4>See also</h4>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.from_T_inv\">from_T_inv</a>,\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">to_T</a>,\n"
