"<h4>Syntax</h4>\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\n"
"T = Frames.<strong>to_T</strong>(R);\n"
"</pre></blockquote>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Description</h4>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This function returns a real matrix&nbsp;T\n"
"<!--<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.Orientation\">transformation matrix</a>&nbsp;T-->\n"
"computed from an\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Orientation\">orientation object</a>&nbsp;R.\n"
"The matrix&nbsp;T is considered to be an object transformation matrix.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>See also</h4>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.from_T\">from_T</a>,\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.to_T_inv\">to_T_inv</a>,\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.TransformationMatrices.to_T\">TransformationMatrices.to_T</a>,\n"
"<a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Frames.Quaternions.to_T\">Quaternions.to_T</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</html>"
