msgctxt "Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Joints.Constraints.Spherical"
msgid "<html>\n"
"<p>This model does not use explicit variables e.g. state variables in order to describe the relative motion of frame_b with to respect to frame_a, but defines kinematic constraints between the frame_a and frame_b. The forces and torques at both frames are then evaluated in such a way that the constraints are satisfied. Sometimes this type of formulation is also called an implicit joint in literature.</p>\n"
