"<h4>Syntax</h4>\n"
"<blockquote><pre>\n"
"             number = Strings.<strong>scanInteger</strong>(string);\n"
"(number, nextIndex) = Strings.<strong>scanInteger</strong>(string, startIndex=1,\n"
